<title>USA: CEO holds 5.9 pct Israel Land stake.</title>
<headline>CEO holds 5.9 pct Israel Land stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ofer Nimrodi, chief executive officer of Israel Land Development Co Ltd said Tuesday he holds a 5.9 percent stake in the company or 1,670,501 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Nimrodi said the latest transaction includes the purchase of 1,274,984 shares between July 22 and July 23 at a price ranging from 6.93 New Israeli Shekels to 7.66 NIS per share.</p>
<p>Nimrodi said he bought the shares for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
